1
00:00:18,519 --> 00:00:19,769
JAM SEBELAS

2
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:22,356
5.00 PETANG - 6.00 PETANG

3
00:00:38,288 --> 00:00:41,250
- Sekarang buat apa?
- Kita tunggu.

4
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:42,918
Berapa lama...

5
00:00:43,794 --> 00:00:45,419
Saya tak tahu.

6
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:48,340
- Mungkin beberapa jam.
- Ini rasa salah.

7
00:00:49,258 --> 00:00:51,885
- Ingat, Dr. Robby kata...
- Masih rasa salah.

8
00:00:53,929 --> 00:00:56,847
Okey. Ini keputusan Roxy.

9
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:59,726
Dia tak dapat kawal perkara lain
kecuali kematiannya.

10
00:01:00,561 --> 00:01:02,437
Dia pilih jalan ini.

11
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:06,858
- Tak ramai mampu buat begitu.
- Saya patut rawat pesakit.

12
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:15,366
- Adam tinggal di Middle Hill?
- Tepat sekali.

13
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:18,120
- Dia tiga tahun lebih tua?
- Lebih tua daripada saya.

14
00:01:19,329 --> 00:01:23,208
Dia minta awak
jadi kekasihnya enam bulan lalu?

15
00:01:24,626 --> 00:01:29,006
Dia minta pada malam permainan
dan saya bersetuju.

16
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:32,258
Ada pesakit vertigo di katil 13.

17
00:01:32,259 --> 00:01:34,052
Okey, saya akan ke sana.

18
00:01:37,347 --> 00:01:40,099
Ada Adam tanya awak
jika awak mahu berasmara?

19
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:42,769
Mel, saya tak pasti
jika saya boleh beritahu.

20
00:01:43,770 --> 00:01:45,354
Boleh, saya kakak awak.

21
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:46,690
Ini hal peribadi.

22
00:01:47,399 --> 00:01:50,026
Penting untuk saya tahu.

23
00:01:50,027 --> 00:01:51,445
- Kenapa?
- Sebab...

24
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:56,867
Saya boleh beritahu Dr. Langdon
sebab dia doktor saya, tapi...

25
00:01:57,743 --> 00:02:00,119
- Tak boleh beritahu awak.
- Cakaplah!

26
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:02,121
- Kenapa tinggikan suara?
- Tak pun.

27
00:02:02,122 --> 00:02:04,498
Penting untuk saya tahu.

28
00:02:04,499 --> 00:02:05,834
- Awak jerit.
- Becca.

29
00:02:06,585 --> 00:02:09,378
- Baik keluar kejap.
- Kenapa tak beritahu?

30
00:02:09,379 --> 00:02:10,589
Dr. King.

31
00:02:11,548 --> 00:02:13,133
Apa kata awak keluar?

32
00:02:16,637 --> 00:02:17,554
Maaf.

33
00:02:25,395 --> 00:02:27,229
Awak nampak juruteknik X-ray?

34
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:28,190
Tak.

35
00:02:30,651 --> 00:02:32,943
- Ada perkembangan?
- Saya cuma tanya.

36
00:02:32,944 --> 00:02:36,072
Apa peluang saya
habis kerja tepat pada masanya?

37
00:02:36,073 --> 00:02:39,326
Kami boleh buat tanpa awak.
Persoalannya, adakah awak benarkan?

38
00:02:45,791 --> 00:02:47,084
Bagaimana awak berdua?

39
00:02:47,709 --> 00:02:49,670
Saya boleh tahan dua jam lagi.

40
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:54,215
Dia panggil "Doc".

41
00:02:54,216 --> 00:02:57,426
Saya tak tahu dia doktor sebenar
sehingga beberapa bulan kemudian.

42
00:02:57,427 --> 00:02:59,680
Dia merahsiakan kehidupannya.

43
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,223
Bagaimana dengan X-ray dada?

44
00:03:02,224 --> 00:03:04,309
X-ray masih menunggu giliran.

45
00:03:04,935 --> 00:03:06,311
Bila kali terakhir periksa?

46
00:03:07,896 --> 00:03:09,356
Sepuluh minit lalu.

47
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:10,606
- Pergi tengok.
- Ya.

48
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:11,899
Janganlah desak dia.

49
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:14,276
Tertulis, ambil masa sejam
untuk X-ray.

50
00:03:14,277 --> 00:03:16,405
Awak orang pertama
yang baca benda ini.

51
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,243
Menyampah betul.

52
00:03:23,453 --> 00:03:26,373
- Bagaimana keadaan awak?
- Saya baik.

53
00:03:28,083 --> 00:03:30,251
Saya ambil Lexapro.

54
00:03:30,252 --> 00:03:32,253
Redakan serangan panik
dan kemurungan.

55
00:03:32,254 --> 00:03:33,839
Sungguh, saya okey.

56
00:03:35,090 --> 00:03:36,842
Maaf, Pn. Torres.

57
00:03:37,217 --> 00:03:39,343
Awak okey? Awak hampir pengsan.

58
00:03:39,344 --> 00:03:42,222
Semuanya baik.
Mari teruskan pemeriksaan.

59
00:03:44,641 --> 00:03:48,853
Betis kanan Pn. Torres
bengkak selama seminggu.

60
00:03:48,854 --> 00:03:52,815
Tiada luka, demam atau sejarah
masalah pembekuan darah.

61
00:03:52,816 --> 00:03:57,403
Tapi dia naik bas selama 15 jam dari
Orlando ke Pittsburgh minggu lepas.

62
00:03:57,404 --> 00:03:58,988
Pn. Torres...

63
00:03:58,989 --> 00:04:02,533
Kami risau kemungkinan
darah beku pada kaki awak

64
00:04:02,534 --> 00:04:04,535
yang boleh menyebabkan komplikasi.

65
00:04:04,536 --> 00:04:06,537
Kami perlu buat ultrabunyi, tapi...

66
00:04:06,538 --> 00:04:09,624
Tak perlu risau. Jika positif,
kami guna pencair darah.

67
00:04:10,917 --> 00:04:13,003
Saya belajar untuk berhenti risau.

68
00:04:13,754 --> 00:04:16,298
Kerisauan tak beri kebaikan
dalam hidup.

69
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,261
Keputusan makmal.
Satu yang kritikal.

70
00:04:22,262 --> 00:04:24,013
Mereka patut telefon.

71
00:04:24,014 --> 00:04:26,182
Setiap kali cuba,
telefon merah sibuk.

72
00:04:26,183 --> 00:04:29,185
Demi Tuhan,
sepatutnya dapat 25 minit lalu.

73
00:04:29,186 --> 00:04:31,688
Natrium 112. Mohan!

74
00:04:33,148 --> 00:04:35,567
Tabur garam pada pesakit awak
sebelum dia sawan.

75
00:04:36,318 --> 00:04:37,526
Apa perkembangan kita?

76
00:04:37,527 --> 00:04:40,780
Pesakit batu karang tak terhalang.
Sedang tunggu ubat.

77
00:04:40,781 --> 00:04:43,866
Ortopedik sedang sambungkan kaki
pesakit taman air.

78
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:48,162
Pesakit divertikulitis,
Howard selamat dibedah.

79
00:04:48,163 --> 00:04:51,832
Saya nak hubungi sumber CYF
untuk tahu jika ada perkembangan

80
00:04:51,833 --> 00:04:54,668
tentang penjagaan kecemasan
bayi Jane Doe.

81
00:04:54,669 --> 00:04:57,797
Selain itu, keputusan makmal
dan X-ray makin lambat,

82
00:04:57,798 --> 00:04:59,800
tapi geng Golden Girls
semakin pantas.

83
00:05:01,551 --> 00:05:04,303
Robby biasanya balik
sebaik syif tamat

84
00:05:04,304 --> 00:05:07,890
atau dia tunggu
penyerahan tugas syif malam?

85
00:05:07,891 --> 00:05:10,477
Bergantung. Biasanya terus balik.

86
00:05:14,147 --> 00:05:15,981
Sesak nafas di Selatan 16.

87
00:05:15,982 --> 00:05:17,818
Harap keadaannya makin teruk.

88
00:05:19,653 --> 00:05:22,279
Saya nak buat satu intubasi lagi
sebelum pukul 7.00.

89
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,406
Barulah cukup tiga kali
dalam minggu pertama.

90
00:05:24,407 --> 00:05:26,201
Mungkin satu pencapaian.

91
00:05:27,911 --> 00:05:29,955
Saya cari kes yang mudah.

92
00:05:30,330 --> 00:05:32,374
Syif tamat dalam masa dua jam.

93
00:05:33,291 --> 00:05:35,876
Sepatutnya ambil
pesakit stabil ikut urutan.

94
00:05:35,877 --> 00:05:39,589
- Mahu pendapat kedua?
- Tak.

95
00:05:40,757 --> 00:05:42,216
- Dr. McKay.
- Ya.

96
00:05:42,217 --> 00:05:44,134
Gadis bernama Kiki cari awak.

97
00:05:44,135 --> 00:05:46,178
- Kiki?
- Dia tunggu di taman.

98
00:05:46,179 --> 00:05:47,597
Bagus. Terima kasih.

99
00:05:52,269 --> 00:05:56,188
Hei, sepatutnya dah dapat
keputusan makmal pesakit PID.

100
00:05:56,189 --> 00:05:57,274
Terima kasih.

101
00:05:58,191 --> 00:05:59,651
Semua okey?

102
00:06:01,403 --> 00:06:02,571
Hebat.

103
00:06:06,074 --> 00:06:07,283
Langdon.

104
00:06:07,284 --> 00:06:10,035
Saya harap takkan jumpa dia lagi.

105
00:06:10,036 --> 00:06:13,164
Mungkin dia dah berubah?

106
00:06:16,042 --> 00:06:18,795
- Bila awak ada masa, ada sesuatu...
- Santos!

107
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:21,131
Rawat pesakit
keracunan makanan di katil 12.

108
00:06:21,590 --> 00:06:22,840
Ya, boleh saja.

109
00:06:22,841 --> 00:06:27,219
Tak menyindir atau menolak?
Mana Santos lama pergi?

110
00:06:27,220 --> 00:06:30,348
Tinggal dua jam saja. Saya mengalah.

111
00:06:31,725 --> 00:06:33,143
Macam itulah.

112
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:41,401
- Becca okey?
- Dia okey.

113
00:06:42,110 --> 00:06:45,238
Saya cuba hubungi pusat komunitinya,
tapi tak diangkat.

114
00:06:45,906 --> 00:06:47,240
Kenapa?

115
00:06:48,575 --> 00:06:51,368
Sebab saya tak tahu
apa-apa tentang Adam.

116
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:55,831
Mereka bercinta selama enam bulan
dan saya tak tahu apa-apa.

117
00:06:55,832 --> 00:06:59,877
Dia tak pernah cakap
ada kekasih atau suka sesiapa.

118
00:06:59,878 --> 00:07:01,755
Tak bermakna tak pernah fikir.

119
00:07:02,505 --> 00:07:05,300
Saya tak nak fikir
adik saya fikir tentang seks.

120
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:08,136
Mungkin lelaki itu ambil kesempatan.

121
00:07:08,637 --> 00:07:10,512
Middle Hill biarkan saja.

122
00:07:10,513 --> 00:07:13,015
- Kenapa tak beritahu?
- Mungkin mereka tak tahu.

123
00:07:13,016 --> 00:07:15,101
Enam bulan, mereka pasti tahu.

124
00:07:16,728 --> 00:07:19,397
Mungkin salah memilih Middle Hill.

125
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:21,607
Ada banyak tempat yang bagus,

126
00:07:21,608 --> 00:07:23,735
tapi itulah tempat pilihan Becca.

127
00:07:24,778 --> 00:07:26,905
Awak penjaga sah Becca?

128
00:07:27,447 --> 00:07:29,531
Tak, saya ada surat kuasa wakil.

129
00:07:29,532 --> 00:07:31,241
Pembuatan keputusan berbantu

130
00:07:31,242 --> 00:07:34,496
untuk dia mampu
buat keputusan sendiri.

131
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:36,872
Itu jawapannya.

132
00:07:36,873 --> 00:07:38,874
- Ini berbeza.
- Kenapa?

133
00:07:38,875 --> 00:07:40,961
Sebab memang berbeza. Saya...

134
00:07:46,591 --> 00:07:48,385
Anak saya, badannya tak bergerak.

135
00:07:51,596 --> 00:07:52,514
Okey.

136
00:07:53,473 --> 00:07:54,724
Ayuh, kawan.

137
00:08:00,355 --> 00:08:02,148
Badan panas dan tak responsif.

138
00:08:02,273 --> 00:08:04,109
- Bilik, Dana.
- Trauma Dua.

139
00:08:05,193 --> 00:08:06,945
Ambil suhu teras segera.

140
00:08:08,113 --> 00:08:10,155
Saya Dr. Al-Hashimi. Awak ibunya?

141
00:08:10,156 --> 00:08:11,198
Brenda Azurmendi.

142
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:12,659
- Ini pula?
- Micah.

143
00:08:13,785 --> 00:08:15,453
Micah demam?

144
00:08:15,578 --> 00:08:18,456
Tak, dia okey.
Saya jumpa dia di dalam kereta.

145
00:08:19,874 --> 00:08:21,876
Anak matanya lembab, tapi reaktif.

146
00:08:22,544 --> 00:08:23,878
Tiada reaksi rasa sakit.

147
00:08:26,006 --> 00:08:28,841
Saluran pernafasan terbuka,
isi padu tidal rendah.

148
00:08:28,842 --> 00:08:30,719
Sediakan untuk intubasi.

149
00:08:31,845 --> 00:08:34,138
Degupan jantung,
22 dalam 10 saat, jadi 132.

150
00:08:34,139 --> 00:08:36,473
- Awak tahu beratnya?
- Tak.

151
00:08:36,474 --> 00:08:38,350
- Joy, Broselow?
- Apa?

152
00:08:38,351 --> 00:08:41,478
Pita Broselow beri panduan
dos ubat berdasarkan panjang.

153
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:44,231
Bantu pengudaraan
dengan beg ventilasi.

154
00:08:44,232 --> 00:08:46,025
Awak jumpa dia di dalam kereta?

155
00:08:46,026 --> 00:08:49,319
Saya berkebun,
dia tunggang basikal di laman depan.

156
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,905
Sedar-sedar saja dia hilang.

157
00:08:51,906 --> 00:08:54,825
Saya sangka dia masuk ke rumah,
tapi saya tak jumpa dia.

158
00:08:54,826 --> 00:08:59,121
Mungkin dia penat,
masuk ke dalam kereta dan tertidur.

159
00:08:59,122 --> 00:09:01,915
Apabila saya jumpa dia,
saya tak dapat sedarkan dia.

160
00:09:01,916 --> 00:09:03,125
Berapa lama?

161
00:09:03,126 --> 00:09:05,961
Mungkin 15 minit atau...

162
00:09:05,962 --> 00:09:07,881
- Dua puluh?
- Kereta tak berkunci?

163
00:09:08,715 --> 00:09:10,257
Kejiranan kami selamat.

164
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:11,426
Joy?

165
00:09:11,968 --> 00:09:15,972
Okey, awak perlu mula di kepala.

166
00:09:17,057 --> 00:09:18,474
Ukur panjangnya.

167
00:09:18,475 --> 00:09:19,851
Kemudian, baca.

168
00:09:20,226 --> 00:09:22,603
Berat anggaran 25kg.

169
00:09:22,604 --> 00:09:24,271
250 bolus LR.

170
00:09:24,272 --> 00:09:26,190
Dos rokuronium dan ketamin.

171
00:09:26,191 --> 00:09:28,276
Saya boleh buat tanpa ubat.

172
00:09:28,735 --> 00:09:30,986
Teruskan beg ventilasi,
kita tunggu RT.

173
00:09:30,987 --> 00:09:34,406
Apabila suhu tinggi,
otot boleh kehilangan kekuatan.

174
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:36,492
Kami bantu dia bernafas melalui tiub.

175
00:09:36,493 --> 00:09:39,328
Suhu rektal ialah 105.5.

176
00:09:39,329 --> 00:09:41,538
- Strok haba.
- Pek ais, selangkang dan ketiak.

177
00:09:41,539 --> 00:09:43,373
Tengok jika ada Arctic Sun.

178
00:09:43,374 --> 00:09:44,584
Kita perlukan banyak ais.

179
00:09:45,668 --> 00:09:47,504
Satu beg mayat pediatrik.

180
00:09:51,049 --> 00:09:52,841
Kami masih tunggu pil Ketorolac.

181
00:09:52,842 --> 00:09:54,426
Saya akan terus buat susulan.

182
00:09:54,427 --> 00:09:56,095
Saya beritahu anak saya.

183
00:09:56,096 --> 00:09:57,554
Kami tengok bunga api bersama.

184
00:09:57,555 --> 00:09:59,723
Maaf, En. Green,
kami takkan lupakan awak.

185
00:09:59,724 --> 00:10:00,683
Baiklah.

186
00:10:05,396 --> 00:10:08,399
- Katanya awak kena serangan jantung.
- Mana ada.

187
00:10:09,484 --> 00:10:12,779
- Hei, Samira. Awak okey?
- Saya baik.

188
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:15,197
Mujurlah.

189
00:10:15,198 --> 00:10:17,449
Boleh jaga pesakit saya kejap?

190
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:19,785
- Saya perlu keluar.
- Tiada masalah.

191
00:10:19,786 --> 00:10:23,664
Ogilvie, awak nak ambil angin?
Ada kes yang bagus untuk awak.

192
00:10:23,665 --> 00:10:26,291
Mungkin intubasi diperlukan?

193
00:10:26,292 --> 00:10:29,963
Tak. Pesakit gelandangan saya rawat
dalam pasukan jalanan.

194
00:10:42,142 --> 00:10:43,726
- Hai, Becca.
- Hai.

195
00:10:54,404 --> 00:10:56,072
Maaf saya tinggikan suara.

196
00:10:56,865 --> 00:10:57,907
Saya cuma...

197
00:10:59,409 --> 00:11:00,492
Terkejut.

198
00:11:00,493 --> 00:11:02,162
Jururawat kata saya boleh balik.

199
00:11:02,662 --> 00:11:03,621
Ya.

200
00:11:03,788 --> 00:11:05,664
Boleh selesaikan perbualan kita?

201
00:11:05,665 --> 00:11:06,875
Pasal apa?

202
00:11:07,876 --> 00:11:10,336
Awak tak perlu
beritahu apa-apa, cuma...

203
00:11:11,754 --> 00:11:14,757
saya agak berharap awak kongsikan.

204
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:19,386
Apabila Adam ajak berasmara...

205
00:11:19,387 --> 00:11:22,265
Bukan, saya yang ajak dia.

206
00:11:23,808 --> 00:11:25,935
- Dia tak desak...
- Tak.

207
00:11:26,769 --> 00:11:29,022
Awak sendiri mahu berasmara?

208
00:11:30,106 --> 00:11:32,941
Saya nak berasmara. Rasanya hebat.

209
00:11:32,942 --> 00:11:35,444
Kami cakap tentangnya
dalam kelas minda dan badan,

210
00:11:35,445 --> 00:11:37,322
saya juga beritahu ahli terapi.

211
00:11:39,782 --> 00:11:42,618
Kes pankreatitis di Utara 3
menunggu awak.

212
00:11:42,619 --> 00:11:44,203
- Okey.
- Boleh saya balik?

213
00:11:44,204 --> 00:11:46,038
Sekejap.

214
00:11:46,039 --> 00:11:47,957
Saya nak iring adik keluar.

215
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,840
Ya, saya akan menyusul.

216
00:11:58,259 --> 00:12:00,302
Curtis Larson, 42 tahun.

217
00:12:00,303 --> 00:12:03,014
Kami dipanggil ke padang golf,
dia bergaduh dengan kawan.

218
00:12:03,514 --> 00:12:05,891
Tiada trauma,
hanya nafas berbau alkohol.

219
00:12:05,892 --> 00:12:07,143
Dia dah tenang.

220
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:09,019
Dia melawan kami.

221
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:11,647
Kami beri 4mg Versed
untuk dapat bacaan dan pasang IV.

222
00:12:11,648 --> 00:12:14,274
Tekanan darah bagus,
oksigen 99 pada dua liter.

223
00:12:14,275 --> 00:12:16,652
Mabuk dan Versed,
dia akan tidur seketika.

224
00:12:16,653 --> 00:12:18,196
Pusat 14, semua.

225
00:12:25,328 --> 00:12:26,496
Roxie dah tiada.

226
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:31,416
- Suaminya masih di dalam?
- Ya, Javadi bersama mereka.

